  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "うたごえで　すがたかたちを　かえるほのおのとりは　ずじょうの　ひだまにたましいが　やどったもの　だという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "노랫소리에 따라 모습이 바뀌는 불새는 머리 위에 있던 불덩이에 영혼이 깃든 것이라고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "可以透過歌聲改變外形的火鳥，據說是靈魂寄宿在頭上的火球所形成的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il chante, son oiseau de feu change de forme. Cet oiseau serait né lorsqu’une âme a pris possession de sa boule de feu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der feurige Vogel, der durch Skelokroks Gesang die Gestalt ändert, soll eine Seele sein, die sich in dem Feuerball auf seinem Kopf niederließ.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que el pájaro flamígero al que da forma su canto es un espíritu que moraba en la bola de fuego que le coronaba la cabeza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dice che l’uccello di fuoco, plasmato in varie forme dal suo canto, sia uno spirito che ha preso dimora nella sua palla di fuoco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The fiery bird changes shape when Skeledirge sings. Rumor has it that the bird was born when the fireball on Skeledirge’s head gained a soul.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "歌声で　姿かたちを　変える炎の鳥は　頭上の　火玉に魂が　宿ったもの　だという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能以歌声改变外形的火鸟，据说是由灵魂寄宿在头上的火球所形成的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que el pájaro flamígero al que da forma su canto es un espíritu que moraba en la bola de fuego que le coronaba la cabeza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "やさしい　うたごえは　きいたもののたましいを　いやす。　３０００どの　ほのおでてきを　やきつくす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "고운 노랫소리는 듣는 이의 영혼을 치유한다. 3000도의 불꽃으로 적을 불태운다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "溫柔的歌聲能療癒聽者的靈魂。會使用３０００度的火焰將敵人燒成灰燼。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est capable de carboniser ses adversaires avec des flammes à 3 000 °C. Sa voix douce possède des vertus apaisantes pour l’âme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein sanfter Gesang beruhigt die Seelen all derer, die ihm lauschen. Feinde verbrennt es mit 3000 ℃ heißen Flammen zu Asche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su dulce canto calma el espíritu de quien lo oye. Achicharra a sus enemigos con llamas que llegan a alcanzar los 3000 ºC.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo dolce canto placa l’animo di chiunque lo ascolti. Riduce in cenere il nemico con fiamme che raggiungono i 3.000 ºC.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Skeledirge’s gentle singing soothes the souls of all that hear it. It burns its enemies to a crisp with flames of over 5,400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "優しい　歌声は　聴いた者の魂を　癒す。　３０００度の　炎で敵を　焼き尽くす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "温柔的歌声能治愈听者的灵魂。会使用３０００度的火焰将敌人烧成灰烬。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
